WEBVTT

00:00.480 --> 00:01.880
It is I.

00:05.120 --> 00:08.880
This official Chu Maolun pays respects to Prince of Jin.

00:12.600 --> 00:16.400
A dog by the horse how dare you call yourself a Xuan official?

00:16.480 --> 00:21.320
Your subject no this foreign official once served in Xuan Kingdom.

00:21.400 --> 00:26.680
As prefect of Shuoyang Prefecture this area around Yiyang was once under this foreign official's jurisdiction.

00:26.760 --> 00:32.400
This foreign official heard that Prince of Jin led the royal army north today I risk death to come.

00:32.480 --> 00:38.920
To offer Prince of Jin A strategy to lift the siege of Yiyang I hope Your Highness will permit this foreign official and others.

00:39.000 --> 00:40.840
To enter the city for detailed discussion.

